16         Project title: Transgenerational, personal, and social determinants of overweight and
17         obesity during childhood and adolescence
18         
19         Purpose of the program:
20         	To examine the association between various transgenerational, personal, and environmental factors with
21             childhood and adolescent overweight or obesity among GUTS children
22         	
23             This script creates dataset on environmental factors linked to residential address of NHSII participants.
24             Assummes GUTS participants (children of NHSII participants) lived with mom.
25         
26         
27         Main exposures/Covariates
28             nSES index (continuous) [NSES_XX, where XX=year]
29             Greenspace (annual mean, continuous NDVI 0 to 1) [NDVI1YRXX NDVI2YRXX, where XX=year]
30             Air pollution, PM2.5 PM10, NO2 (continuous) [PM25__: PM10__: NO2__:]
31             Temperature: summer mean [TMEANS:] summer max [TMAXS] summer min [TMINS:]
32         					winter mean [TMEANW:] winter max [TMAXW:] winter min [TMINW:]
2                                                      The SAS System                             12:42 Monday, March 3, 2025

33         	Number of fastfood stores: within a 500m buffer [FASTFOOD500:], a 1000m buffer [FASTFOOD1000:], and 1500m buffer
